OHOS arm64 port for Go 1.27.3, based on the official OpenHarmony Go
release-branch.go1.24 at 302a5306b6fad2f47196360b82561d1db1f954cf.
Go 1.27 security/runtime fixes remain in the base; only the OHOS port is carried.
The ARM64 TLS opcode and early GODEBUG handling are adapted for Go 1.27.

